ABOUT=section('''<div class="about-grid"><div id="leadership"><p class="label bronze">Philosophy &amp; Leadership</p><h2 class="section-title">Ownership Beyond the Implementation</h2><p class="body-copy">I’m based in Fayetteville, Arkansas, with a background in computer science and experience across enterprise IT and software development. I’m most interested in the intersection of technical architecture, automation, leadership, and business strategy.</p><p class="body-copy">My next chapter is about broader ownership: guiding technology decisions, improving processes, and leading projects and people. I’m pursuing opportunities in technology management, systems architecture, platform engineering, and business transformation.</p><div class="philosophy">Understand the people and the process. Then build the system that serves them.</div></div><div id="experience"><p class="label mb-5">Professional Experience</p>'''+ROLES+'''</div></div><div class="credentials"><div>'''+EDUCATION+'''</div><div>'''+SKILLS+'''<h3 class="mt-6">Community</h3><p>Women in Technology of Northwest Arkansas; founding member of Girls in Tech at the University of Arkansas; University of Arkansas High School Programming Contest volunteer.</p></div></div>''')
